10. GUBON-9 Contract

Kernel:

GLS-PROD-1.0.0

Canonical GUBON state:

1–9

Raw/intermediate calculations may contain 0.

0 is never a GUBON state.

export function digitalRoot(value: number): GubonDigit {
  if (!Number.isFinite(value)) {
    throw new TypeError("VALUE_MUST_BE_FINITE");
  }

  const integer = Math.abs(Math.trunc(value));

  if (integer === 0) {
    throw new RangeError("ZERO_IS_NOT_A_GUBON_STATE");
  }

  const result = 1 + ((integer - 1) % 9);

  return result as GubonDigit;
}

No second kernel is permitted.


